      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L3",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 13:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tomas Venn (Former Tenant)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L5",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 13:26:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Advised that works were being arranged at 18 Brindle Row and that we would contact him to agree access while he was still at the property.",
      "start": 122,
      "end": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L1",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 13:51:20 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Venn (Former Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L2",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 13:51:20 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Venn (Former Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Tomas Venn (Former Tenant)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 59
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 13:51:20 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Venn (Former Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 60,
      "end": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 13:51:20 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Venn (Former Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Said he had vacated on 27 August and returned the keys that day. He could not provide access and asked that records be updated and arrangements made with the appropriate person.",
      "start": 122,
      "end": 299
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 15:16:19 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 15:16:19 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 15:16:19 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-04 15:16:19 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Classified the request as handyman work and sent the landlord an approval request. The request described the six listed items and said the agency could arrange a provider; no cost estimate was included.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 347
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:04 UTC",
      "sender": "Ivo Marlow (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:04 UTC",
      "sender": "Ivo Marlow (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Ivo Marlow (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:04 UTC",
      "sender": "Ivo Marlow (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:04 UTC",
      "sender": "Ivo Marlow (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Replied, “Yes, I am happy for you to proceed with the remedial works.” No price limit, item-by-item instructions, or other conditions were stated.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 263
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 09:44:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Landlord approval recorded. Provider selection remained necessary before quotation or scheduling.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 242
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:51:49 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:51:49 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:51:49 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:51:49 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Selected Alder & Finch Repairs to provide a quotation and asked the provider for availability and key-access requirements for an inspection. The note records that no work was to begin until the quote had been reviewed and written authority issued. The tenant had already said he returned the keys; the agency held a set.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 465
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:09 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:09 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:09 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:09 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Sent the six-item description and requested a quotation only. The email expressly said not to carry out any work until Northbridge Lettings reviewed the price and issued written authority. It asked for two or three possible inspection windows and confirmation of access requirements, and said arrangements would be confirmed with the tenant despite his earlier notice that he had left.",
      "start": 142,
      "end": 527
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Ivo Marlow (Landlord)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 10:53:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Advised that scheduling was underway and that a convenient time was being agreed with the tenant and provider.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 227
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-08 10:51:52 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-08 10:51:52 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 83
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-08 10:51:52 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-08 10:51:52 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Chased for availability and access details. The reminder included a tenant contact number, although the tenant had already said he had vacated and was not arranging access.",
      "start": 142,
      "end": 314
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 10:51:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 10:51:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 10:51:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 10:51:40 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "No provider reply or appointment slot was on file. The case was escalated for a decision on whether to chase, confirm key access, or change provider.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 294
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:57:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L2",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:57:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L3",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:57:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L5",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:57:57 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Recorded an instruction to wait for the provider's response rather than send another reminder. The note referred to awaiting an invoice, although no invoice had yet been received.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 324
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L1",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 12:00:48 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L2",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 12:00:48 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L3",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 12:00:48 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 139
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 12:00:48 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Maya called about a quotation. Rowan said he had not realised a quote was needed and thought the instruction was to carry out the work; he said he had completed it the previous day. Maya asked him to send an invoice, and Rowan agreed to send it with paperwork that evening. The call did not establish when or how access had been arranged, who had authorised work to start, or the agreed scope and price.",
      "start": 141,
      "end": 544
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 79
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 80,
      "end": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:15 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Forwarded an invoice from Alder & Finch Repairs for the property, without accompanying explanatory message.",
      "start": 142,
      "end": 249
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:30 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:30 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:30 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:57:30 UTC",
      "sender": "Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Invoice recorded at £174. The case had no appointment details, visit narrative, or separate completion evidence.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 257
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:58:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Document",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Document",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:58:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Document",
      "text": "- **From:** Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "start": 24,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L3",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:58:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Document",
      "text": "- **To:** Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 143
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L5",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:58:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Document",
      "text": "Invoice description lists replacing the broken lounge floorboard and reinstating carpet; removing the front lounge blind and supplying and installing a new Venetian blind; refixing the cupboard handle with new fixings; adjusting the kitchen blind mechanism; retightening the toilet seat; and reattaching the front-gate hinge with new fixings. No quotation, itemised prices, prior approval of variations, or payment terms are described in the accompanying message.",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 608
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L7",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 06:58:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Rowan Pike (Contractor, Alder & Finch Repairs)",
      "channel": "Document",
      "text": "Challenge attachments supplied with the complete case record: [remedial-works-invoice.pdf](attachments/remedial-works-invoice.pdf).",
      "start": 610,
      "end": 741
    },
